<title>USA: Gabelli groups ups Gray stake to 12.85 pct.</title>
<headline>Gabelli groups ups Gray stake to 12.85 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Monday it holds 449,700 shares of Gray Communications Systems Inc., or 12.85 percent of the total of 3.5 million shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it spent $762,025 on recent stock purchases that triggered the filing.</p>
<p>On Oct. 7, the group told the SEC it held a 10.49 percent stake, or 367,000 shares.</p>
